WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.959
There is no Military Whistleblower Protection Act in Canada.

00:00:03.909 --> 00:00:08.636
The United States has had one since 1988 — thirty-eight years.

00:00:08.636 --> 00:00:10.545
Canada has nothing.

00:00:10.545 --> 00:00:16.443
The Public Servants Disclosure Protection Act explicitly excludes Canadian Forces members by statute.

00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:19.556
CSIS and CSE are also exempt.

00:00:19.556 --> 00:00:24.443
The people most likely to witness government misconduct... have the least legal protection.

00:00:24.443 --> 00:00:27.181
Criminal Code Section 504.

00:00:27.181 --> 00:00:36.511
Any person who, on reasonable grounds, believes that a person has committed an indictable offence may lay an information in writing and under oath before a Justice of the Peace.

00:00:36.511 --> 00:00:38.590
No lawyer required.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:41.068
This is a constitutional right.

00:00:41.068 --> 00:00:43.772
It has existed since Confederation.

00:00:43.772 --> 00:00:48.238
And it is the most powerful legal tool available to any Canadian whistleblower.

00:00:48.238 --> 00:00:51.852
Three oversight bodies are available simultaneously.

00:00:51.852 --> 00:00:56.852
The Military Police Complaints Commission — one-year filing window, no lawyer needed.

00:00:56.852 --> 00:01:01.397
The DND and CF Ombudsman — independent from the chain of command.

00:01:01.397 --> 00:01:05.556
And the Public Sector Integrity Commissioner — for federal institutions.

00:01:05.556 --> 00:01:07.636
The strategy is simple.

00:01:07.636 --> 00:01:09.613
Document everything.

00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:11.499
Preserve everything.

00:01:11.499 --> 00:01:13.306
Publish everything.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:16.818
The institution's power comes from controlling the narrative.

00:01:16.818 --> 00:01:20.829
Your power comes from making the evidence public before they can suppress it.

00:01:20.829 --> 00:01:27.704
If you are in crisis, call the Veterans Affairs Crisis Line at 1-800-268-7708.

00:01:27.704 --> 00:01:31.045
Twenty-four hours a day, seven days a week.

00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:34.465
Canada Suicide Prevention: 9-8-8.

00:01:34.465 --> 00:01:39.920
Crisis Services Canada: 1-833-456-4566.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.727
You are not alone.

00:01:41.727 --> 00:01:43.920
And the law is on your side.
